; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 3 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 11:45 \u2022 349m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 20.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/03)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 25.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30\/06)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3:<\/strong> 30.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/08)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Azores Bravos Trail 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Azores Bravos Trail 2026 realiza-se no dia 3 de Outubro de 2026 (S\u00e1bado), na Ilha Terceira, com centro nevr\u00e1lgico e meta no Parque Municipal do Relv\u00e3o, em Angra do Hero\u00edsmo, A\u00e7ores.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis no Azores Bravos Trail 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento contempla cinco modalidades: AzBT 100K (100.2 km), AzBT 50K (51.8 km), AzBT 35K (35.2 km), AzBT 15K (15.5 km) e uma Caminhada (10.1 km).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como posso fazer a minha inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no Azores Bravos Trail 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es devem ser efetuadas online atrav\u00e9s da plataforma oficial StopandGo at\u00e9 ao limite de vagas estabelecido pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Existe equipamento obrigat\u00f3rio para a prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, dada a imprevisibilidade do tempo na Ilha Terceira e a extens\u00e3o dos percursos, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o exige telem\u00f3vel carregado, reserva de \u00e1gua, manta de sobreviv\u00eancia, apito e casaco imperme\u00e1vel.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar os resultados e fotografias do Azores Bravos Trail 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os resultados oficiais em tempo real e a galeria de fotografias ser\u00e3o disponibilizados na plataforma StopandGo e divulgados no Portugal Running ap\u00f3s a conclus\u00e3o de todas as dist\u00e2ncias.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Azores Bravos Trail 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-03\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Angra do Hero\u00edsmo\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Angra do Hero\u00edsmo\", \"addressRegion\": \"A\u00e7ores\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo da Ilha Terceira (AAIT)\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Azores Bravos Trail 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Azores Bravos Trail 2026 realiza-se no dia 3 de Outubro de 2026 (S\u00e1bado), na Ilha Terceira, com centro nevr\u00e1lgico e meta no Parque Municipal do Relv\u00e3o, em Angra do Hero\u00edsmo, A\u00e7ores.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis no Azores Bravos Trail 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento contempla cinco modalidades: AzBT 100K (100.2 km), AzBT 50K (51.8 km), AzBT 35K (35.2 km), AzBT 15K (15.5 km) e uma Caminhada (10.1 km).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como posso fazer a minha inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no Azores Bravos Trail 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es devem ser efetuadas online atrav\u00e9s da plataforma oficial StopandGo at\u00e9 ao limite de vagas estabelecido pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Existe equipamento obrigat\u00f3rio para a prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, dada a imprevisibilidade do tempo na Ilha Terceira e a extens\u00e3o dos percursos, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o exige telem\u00f3vel carregado, reserva de \u00e1gua, manta de sobreviv\u00eancia, apito e casaco imperme\u00e1vel.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso consultar os resultados e fotografias do Azores Bravos Trail 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os resultados oficiais em tempo real e a galeria de fotografias ser\u00e3o disponibilizados na plataforma StopandGo e divulgados no Portugal Running ap\u00f3s a conclus\u00e3o de todas as dist\u00e2ncias.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66211,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,622,498,499],"event_type_2":[104,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-48211","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-angra-do-heroismo-ilha-terceira-acores","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-endurance","event_type-trail-longo","event_type-trail-ultra","event_type_2-acores","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/azores-bravos-trail-2026.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/48211","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=48211"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/48211\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":65626,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/48211\/revisions\/65626"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/66211"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=48211"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=48211"},{"taxonomy":"event_type","e